WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.828 --> 00:00:05.745
(speaking in foreign language)

00:00:22.108 --> 00:00:23.574
- [Narrator] Meet the
husband and wife team

00:00:23.574 --> 00:00:27.013
selling a delectable treat
on the streets of Bangkok.

00:00:27.013 --> 00:00:30.930
(speaking in foreign language)

00:00:31.981 --> 00:00:34.582
The couple met six year ago, when Baitoey

00:00:34.582 --> 00:00:36.155
was frequenting Lek's stall.

00:00:36.155 --> 00:00:39.116
They eventually were married,
and she joined his business.

00:00:39.116 --> 00:00:41.837
Today, they sell a variety
of deep-fried insects

00:00:41.837 --> 00:00:45.651
near Khaosan Road, a popular tourist area.

00:00:45.651 --> 00:00:48.651
While their menu may vary,
their process is the same.

00:00:48.651 --> 00:00:50.098
So, let's start at the beginning,

00:00:50.098 --> 00:00:52.343
which is actually the end of the day.

00:00:52.343 --> 00:00:56.260
(speaking in foreign language)

00:01:20.298 --> 00:01:24.254
And if you think that all bugs
taste the same, think again.

00:01:24.254 --> 00:01:28.171
(speaking in foreign language)

00:02:01.170 --> 00:02:02.787
Eating bugs used to be associated

00:02:02.787 --> 00:02:05.706
with poverty in Thailand, but
that's not the case anymore,

00:02:05.706 --> 00:02:09.041
and it's not just tourists
who enjoy this novel treat.

00:02:09.041 --> 00:02:12.958
(speaking in foreign language)

00:02:23.396 --> 00:02:25.815
But what Lek and Baitoey appreciate most

00:02:25.815 --> 00:02:27.693
is the support they provide for each other

00:02:27.693 --> 00:02:29.478
each and every day.

00:02:29.478 --> 00:02:33.395
(speaking in foreign language)

00:02:49.328 --> 00:02:51.411
(jingle)

